        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12406303/comment/12639070",
          "id": "12639070",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ppakulski",
            "name": "ppakulski",
            "key": "ppakulski",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Przemyslaw Pakulski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "I've examined that all the libraries are ok. \n\nProblem seems to be related to old issue  JCR-487, our version storage still contains frozen nodes with jcr:frozenUuid field stored as REFERENCE instead of STRING. \n\nMethod internalValue().toString() works in both cases, whilst getString() on jcr:frozenUUID fails for such nodes :(.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ppakulski",
            "name": "ppakulski",
            "key": "ppakulski",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Przemyslaw Pakulski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2008-10-13T14:49:09.793+0000",
          "updated": "2008-10-13T14:49:09.793+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12406303/comment/12639074",
          "id": "12639074",
          "author": {
